		{"id":"0b5a3771d54d50f8","type":"text","text":"反射和 springaop 都是运行状态执行的，反射是运行状态获取自身信息，而 spring aop 是运行状态对方法进行功能加强","x":-16309,"y":25266,"width":442,"height":94},
		{"id":"5614a97af49b0f1a","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261028104300.png","x":-15768,"y":25280,"width":400,"height":66},
		{"id":"8fa3ff0190a0a2f4","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261028104159.png","x":-16731,"y":25288,"width":331,"height":50},
		{"id":"2040d390d64388e8","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261028155130.png","x":-13545,"y":25256,"width":398,"height":60},
		{"id":"ddfdf7806d17b4a9","type":"text","text":"让代理子类对象，直接调用自己父类的原方法，无反射","x":-14003,"y":25261,"width":398,"height":55},
		{"id":"bf3cd12d0c3b3cd9","type":"text","text":"`MethodInterceptor`：CGLib 的回调接口，对应 JDK 的 InvocationHandler；","x":-14005,"y":25138,"width":416,"height":65},
		{"id":"75b0397690209469","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261023154510.png","x":-8340,"y":25803,"width":567,"height":137},
		{"id":"58bafcfb22d89ecf","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261023154657.png","x":-8340,"y":25940,"width":400,"height":100},
		{"id":"b905fd0e113cc684","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261022171018.png","x":-11940,"y":25162,"width":162,"height":50},
		{"id":"c4736127455e0936","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261022171045.png","x":-11510,"y":25121,"width":699,"height":83},
		{"id":"83f98c8eafd13884","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261023154751.png","x":-8340,"y":26079,"width":400,"height":240},
		{"id":"0775405dad698dd8","type":"text","text":"```\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>cglib</groupId>\n    <artifactId>cglib</artifactId>\n    <version>3.3.0</version>\n</dependency>\n```  \n\n\n```\nimport net.sf.cglib.proxy.Enhancer;\nimport net.sf.cglib.proxy.MethodInterceptor;\nimport net.sf.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy;\n\n// ========== 目标类：没有实现任何接口！ ==========\npublic class OrderService {\n    public void createOrder(String orderNo) {\n        System.out.println(\"【业务】创建订单：\" + orderNo);\n    }\n}\n\n// ========== 方法拦截器 CGLib 的回调 ==========\npublic class CglibInterceptor implements MethodInterceptor {\n    // 目标对象\n    private final Object target;\n\n    public CglibInterceptor(Object target) {\n        this.target = target;\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * @param obj 生成的代理子类对象\n     * @param method 被拦截的方法反射对象\n     * @param args 参数\n     * @param methodProxy CGLib独有的MethodProxy，用来fastCall\n     */\n    @Override\n    public Object intercept(Object obj, Method method, Object[] args, MethodProxy methodProxy) throws Throwable {\n        System.out.println(\"【CGLib代理-前置】方法开始：\" + method.getName());\n        // ✅ 重点：methodProxy.invokeSuper 不是反射！\n        // 直接调用父类（原OrderService）的方法，走fastCall，性能更高\n        Object result = methodProxy.invokeSuper(obj, args);\n        System.out.println(\"【CGLib代理-后置】方法结束：\" + method.getName());\n        return result;\n    }\n\n    // 生成代理对象\n    public Object getProxy() {\n        Enhancer enhancer = new Enhancer();\n        // 设置父类：CGLib生成的代理类继承这个目标类\n        enhancer.setSuperclass(target.getClass());\n        // 设置拦截回调\n        enhancer.setCallback(this);\n        // 创建代理子类\n        return enhancer.create();\n    }\n}\n\n// ========== 测试 ==========\npublic class CglibProxyTest {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        OrderService target = new OrderService();\n        CglibInterceptor interceptor = new CglibInterceptor(target);\n        OrderService proxy = (OrderService) interceptor.getProxy();\n        proxy.createOrder(\"ORD20261028\");\n\n        System.out.println(\"代理对象类型：\" + proxy.getClass());\n        // OrderService$$EnhancerByCGLIB$$xxxxxx  是它的子类\n    }\n}\n```","x":-13505,"y":24976,"width":555,"height":205},
		{"id":"6fd9320c638f5b45","type":"text","text":"日志","x":-16227,"y":25069,"width":90,"height":50},
