		{"id":"e1c85cf62cf8bf7e","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261023173453.png","x":-15597,"y":19716,"width":400,"height":162},
		{"id":"a07e9629eb71446d","type":"text","text":"ConfigurationClassPostProcessor 是 BeanFactoryPostProcessor 的实现类","x":-10764,"y":19888,"width":629,"height":50},
		{"id":"2f32d18c88eee1d4","type":"text","text":"它的工作时机是 BeanFactory 已经就绪、但是 Bean 实例还没有创建的时候，做包扫描、解析配置类，注册 BeanDefinition。","x":-10016,"y":19874,"width":441,"height":78},
		{"id":"58e4da200a8a8879","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261023173443.png","x":-16120,"y":19759,"width":400,"height":38},
