		{"id":"f4604472ad89e87c","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261027165044.png","x":-4371,"y":17716,"width":400,"height":206},
		{"id":"100d53700080ce53","type":"text","text":"A 拿到 B，继续走完自己的初始化、后续 AOP 步骤（会判断已经提前生成过代理，不再重复创建）。","x":-2338,"y":17591,"width":833,"height":50},
		{"id":"60b2a329f53293f4","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261020234844.png","x":-1665,"y":17212,"width":1258,"height":65},
