		{"id":"00c0caccf49db2d5","type":"text","text":"属性注入阶段就需要把 Bean 暴露给依赖方","x":-4767,"y":17320,"width":366,"height":50},
		{"id":"be00f10e57f439d7","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261020234930.png","x":-1980,"y":17361,"width":400,"height":80},
		{"id":"d47ed77b1d107cfd","type":"file","file":"Pasted image 20261020234942.png","x":-1413,"y":17377,"width":755,"height":50},
		{"id":"78848e9c8a1e1fe2","type":"text","text":"前置和后置处理，包装","x":-10385,"y":19342,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9f63605fb0a9a23f","type":"text","text":"是 Bean 定义信息阶段，还没实例化创建 Bean，不属于 Bean 实例的生命周期！","x":-10681,"y":19228,"width":602,"height":50},
		{"id":"e0f24f97c3ecbbf6","type":"text","text":"**单例Bean 就绪，放入单例池（singletonObjects）**，容器中可以正常使用（单例缓存池中）","x":-10442,"y":18656,"width":416,"height":56},
		{"id":"0d7b94c013bb6c27","type":"text","text":"能干啥：修改 Bean 定义，改属性、改 scope、新增 BeanDefinition。\n\n>","x":-10016,"y":19228,"width":453,"height":50},
		{"id":"7157258d62e9cf0d","type":"text","text":"**Bean 正常使用阶段**（业务调用）","x":-9899,"y":18662,"width":291,"height":50},
		{"id":"3f19ad6ab594d9aa","type":"text","text":"**BeanPostProcessor 前置处理（postProcessBeforeInitialization）**：初始化之前的后置处理器（Processor处理器的意思）","x":-10966,"y":18464,"width":570,"height":50},
		{"id":"98178f1008e4563c","type":"text","text":"BeanPostProcessor 讲座后置处理的前置处理","x":-10267,"y":18456,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1c205a319831edc5","type":"text","text":"**销毁阶段（Destruction）**：容器关闭时执行顺序\n\n@PreDestroy 标注的⽅法\n\nDisposableBean 接⼝的 destroy ⽅法\n\n通过 @Bean 的 destroyMethod 指定的销毁⽅法","x":-9359,"y":18628,"width":461,"height":169},
		{"id":"2f12f08e6c7040a3","type":"text","text":"底层 DefaultListableBeanFactory 完成 Bean 实例化并执行 Bean 的完整创建与初始化生命周期；","x":-9957,"y":18280,"width":660,"height":75},
		{"id":"3f1c74f9b5b934f0","type":"text","text":"在 refresh 内部的`finishBeanFactoryInitialization`阶段","x":-10623,"y":18287,"width":597,"height":50},
		{"id":"b5fd04769862ee8e","type":"text","text":"**初始化（Initialization）** 顺序是\n\n先执⾏ @PostConstruct 标注的⽅法\n然后执⾏ InitializingBean 接⼝的 afterPropertiesSet() ⽅法\n最后再执⾏ init-method 指定的⽅法\n也就是说，init-method 是在所有其他初始化⽅法之后执⾏的。\n","x":-11180,"y":18652,"width":572,"height":188},
		{"id":"43484539d8b0777a","type":"text","text":"IOC 容器 ApplicationContext 通过`refresh()`方法完成容器初始化","x":-11267,"y":18287,"width":539,"height":60},
		{"id":"90969931411d65ed","type":"text","text":"单例Bean 销毁阶段在容器关闭时触发。","x":-9197,"y":18287,"width":332,"height":50},
